OL,3,GNEWSAWhen are the overnight closures
OL,4,Afor the M54?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of safety barrier upgrades and
OL,7,Fconstruction work on the M54 motorway
OL,8,Fwill see overnight closures until
OL,9,FJanuary.
OL,11,FNational Highways (NH) said the work,
OL,12,Falong the M54 between the new M6 link
OL,13,Froad and junction 3 at Tong, would
OL,14,Fensure quality and safety and was also
OL,15,Fpart of the main construction project.
OL,17,FWork has been ongoing on the stretch
OL,18,Fsince September, with these closures
OL,19,Ftaking place in Shropshire,
OL,20,FStaffordshire and Wolverhampton.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
